hls.min.js is hls.js 1.6.10 (Apache License 2.0).
https://github.com/video-dev/hls.js

The file is the same build shipped with Native HLS Playback 1.6.10.
formant does not ship that extension, its jQuery, or its older hls.js builds.
Playback UI and the .m3u8 redirect are formant's own code.

mux.min.js is mux.js 6.3.0 (Apache License 2.0).
https://github.com/videojs/mux.js
It remuxes MPEG-TS HLS segments into an MP4 file. formant does not ship ffmpeg.
